{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast desert, you find only one path forward: the towering mountain known as Bael\u2019s Rock.\u00a0Within, ancient trials and cryptic puzzles await \u2013 ready to challenge you at every step toward the summit.\u00a0Test your wits to uncover long-buried secrets and the truth behind the shadowy figure who brought you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael\u2019s Rock</i> is a <strong>parser-based</strong>\u00a0<strong>text adventure\u00a0</strong>inspired by the cult classic <i>Zork</i>. Experience the interactive fiction genre that gave birth to point-and-click games - reimagined for modern players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike simplified choice-based games, you\u2019re not limited to predefined options. <strong>You control your character freely, typing your own commands to interact with the world.</strong> Examine your surroundings, search for and combine items, manipulate strange mechanisms, and solve puzzles \u2013 all through your own ideas and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting and Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Bael\u2019s Rock</i> blends fantasy with light steampunk elements \u2013 a mysterious backdrop filled with secrets, puzzles, and hidden lore. <strong>The journey is divided into seven chapters, each presenting new challenges to overcome</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter introduces the story and serves as a tutorial, guiding you through the basics. From there, you're on your own to tackle increasingly complex puzzles as you carve your path toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael\u2019s Rock</i> offers <strong>a considerable challenge in the spirit of cult classics</strong> \u2013 demanding, yet intuitive to play. As a fully text-based experience, <strong>it requires patience, focus, and a love for reading</strong>. If you're not into puzzles, story-driven exploration, or point-and-click-style logic, this probably isn't the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro mode/High contrast/Accessibility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a retro mode with no graphics and a focus on readability.\u00a0Additionally, the entire game is fully playable and functional without sound, as it features only minor and entirely optional sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/3787bffe006841c1fb0b6e8ce60c25c9.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Ghosts of the Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/148341c4d3201e201c4535407be5bd22b7e77fbd.jpg"},{"name":"The Trial of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/4f12b9533ea86824f0b671c4f8cd99f26da69aa6.jpg"},{"name":"The Firefly Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/2be1ea6bbf6e4c09c38634d752f5481350aa3b3e.jpg"},{"name":"The Duel of Wits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/d3b93206e4504ea1d2bbdaff3983531427b712ba.jpg"},{"name":"The Window Sky High","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/17893de2e66c051eea33608d4123215354a3fd82.jpg"},{"name":"The Maze of Mirrors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/a2e2bd75c138e92b15405731bf4f607e0350eef4.jpg"},{"name":"The Quiet Before the Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/fb62418df46453ea9edb48d2965f3792b279f93e.jpg"},{"name":"The Grue Repellent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/e045486d88c7ad6f80fcf4027a7c34ddb1cc9e69.jpg"},{"name":"The Lord of the Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3694940/3eb6f4887a38ad850537b3636a59bcc7c4f7cd31.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694940?t=1770229371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/